<title>FINLAND: Instrumentarium 8-mth profit rises.</title>
<headline>Instrumentarium 8-mth profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to end-August, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes   183 vs 165</p>
<p> Net sales				   1,498 vs 1,347</p>
<p> Operating profit			    156 vs 133</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast was for a 190 million markka profit (range 185-197) and the average was 191 million.  </p>
<p> Net financial items		   gain 27 vs 31 gain</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			 nil vs 5 charge</p>
<p> Minorities			     charge 1 vs 1 gain</p>
<p> Taxes					    50 vs 49</p>
<p> Net profit				    133 vs 111</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    6.58 vs 5.71</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish medical equipment maker is Instrumentarium Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
